This replication package is released under two licences.

1. Code: MIT License
   Applies to run_all.R and every file in code/.

2. Data compiled by the authors: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
   International (CC BY 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
   Applies to data/raw/shared_nap_data/nap_information.csv,
   data/raw/napa/napa_list_unfccc.csv, the processed panels in
   data/processed/, and the tables and figures in output/.
   Excluded from this grant: the FERDI PVCCI values (data/raw/PVCCI.csv and
   the pvcci-derived columns of the processed panels), which remain under
   FERDI's terms.

Third-party inputs keep their own terms (see README.md, "Data availability"):
OECD CRS (OECD terms, reuse with attribution), World Bank WDI/WGI and OGHIST
(CC BY 4.0), FERDI PVCCI (research use with attribution), UNFCCC public
information. The processed panels are derived from OECD CRS data and must be
cited as such. EM-DAT data are not included and may not be redistributed.

